      <ul>
        <li><strong>the Orbit apps</strong> for iPhone, Mac, Apple&nbsp;TV and Apple&nbsp;Watch, distributed through the App&nbsp;Store ("Apps");</li>
        <li><strong>Orbit Pro</strong>, the optional auto-renewable subscription bought inside the Apps ("Orbit Pro");</li>
        <li><strong>Orbit Cloud</strong>, the services we operate for Orbit Pro subscribers: the relay that reaches your server from outside your home network, and encrypted backup of your library metadata ("Orbit Cloud");</li>
        <li><strong>Orbit Server</strong>, the free server software you install on your own computer or server ("Server").</li>
