      <h2>2. Licence</h2>
      <p>We grant you a personal, non-exclusive, non-transferable licence to install and use the Apps on Apple devices you own or control, in accordance with the App&nbsp;Store terms, and to run the Server on hardware you own or control. The Server is provided free of charge under the licence that accompanies it.</p>
