      <p>You agree not to use Orbit to infringe anyone's rights, to distribute music you are not entitled to distribute, to interfere with Orbit Cloud or other users, or to attempt to gain access to accounts, servers or data that are not yours.</p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>7. Third-party services</h2>
      <p>The Server can look up metadata from providers such as MusicBrainz, Discogs, OpenOpus and Wikipedia. Those requests go from your Server to the provider and are governed by the provider's terms. Metadata is supplied by those services without any guarantee of accuracy from us. Orbit is not affiliated with any of them.</p>
    </section>

